irobot is a Perl script that downloads Web pages recursively. The main advantage    over wget is its ability to get them concurrently. Sirobot is able to continue    aborted downloads, convert absolute links to relative ones, and has a    pattern-matching filter to prevent you from downloading the whole Internet.</font><br>
